// IntroString :
"P3097366034" "Giving is a wonderful way to really enrich yourself...from the inside out.  This is the very heart of Emperor Cole's philosophy and it's so very simple, if you give - you receive.  Sharing, with profit.<br><br>If you have items that you would like to trade (for a fee) with others, the Trading House is where you can make that happen.  You can find it right here in beautiful Imperial City!  Speak to the Trading House Representative if you need more information about the consignment system.<br><br>Oh, and one more thing:  you can actually buy a Temporary Teleport Power to the Trading House.  They sell them right there all the time for a fixed price.<br><br><color orange>Well enough about that, I have the digital display over there that you can read for more information.  So please, take a look.</color>"
// AcceptString :
