"P706708594" "The fine folks at the Trading House are simply wonderful.  If you're going to invent anything or you think you'll ever want to buy something, well that is simply the place to be! <br><br>Well, {HeroName}.  That was your final enlightenment exercise.  Congratulations.  You have successfully completed the I.P.E.C.A.C. coursework and now you are an Inventor!  Take this badge.  You have definitely earned it.<br><br><font color=deepskyblue>You have now completed the Invention Tutorial.</font>"

